{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065101/block/singleImage/3274649/df/01M81QZ0QPRAYH9ACBN162DQMK.jpg?updatedAt=1795355150\"/><figcaption>元朗Grand YOHO本月交投按月增1倍 兩房樓價時光倒流10年前｜二手成交</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示，元朗大型指標屋苑 Grand YOHO 承接力理想，本月錄得 4 宗買賣，較上月全月增 1 倍，平均實用呎價約 17,112 元，按月上升 4% 。 原開價 880 萬放盤 王勤學指， Grand YOHO 1 座高層 F 室，單位實用面積約 508 方呎，兩房梗廚間隔。原開價 880 萬元放盤，經議價後減價 16.2 萬元，以 863.8 萬元沽出，呎價約 17,004 元。 據悉，原業主於 2016 年以 858.3 萬元一手買入單位，持貨約 10 年轉售，帳面微賺 5.5 萬元或約 0.6% ，惟計及使費料要損手離場。 即睇元朗 Grand YOHO 放盤 (House730)</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065101/block/singleImage/3274653/wm/01M81R06D3SZVCVWXSTDS1N3XK.jpg?updatedAt=1795355150\"/><figcaption>Grand YOHO本月平均實用呎價約17,112元，按月上升4%。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T15:43:59.600264+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":394,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T14:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T15:09:35.977688+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T15:37:19.793715+00:00","content_hash":"12226e341374cea8a69ee39a08de50c34a10c6ff368d3072300bff8d86e787e1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T15:43:59.600264+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}